  answer: President Franklin Delano Roosevelt
  acceptedAnswers:
  - President Franklin Delano Roosevelt
  hints:
  - "Su cat\xE1logo registrado incluye \xABDemocratic National Convention (July 20,
    1944)\xBB, de 1950, y llega hasta 1950."
  - "\xABFireside Chat #13 - On Purging the Democratic Party (June 24, 1938)\xBB
    presenta una energ\xEDa suave y un pulso cercano a 95 BPM."
  - "Entre sus grabaciones figuran \xABFireside Chat #14 - On the European War (September
    3, 1939)\xBB y \xABFireside Chat #23 - On the Home Front (October 12, 1942)\xBB."
  - "Tambi\xE9n lanz\xF3 \xABFireside Chat #6 - On Government and Capitalism (September
    30, 1934)\xBB."
  - "Es el proyecto musical detr\xE1s de \xABFireside Chat #20 - On the Progress
    of the War (February 23, 1942)\xBB y \xABFireside Chat #27 - On the Tehran and
    Cairo Conferences (December 24, 1943)\xBB."
